    "measured_sgd_phase_seconds": "wall time from the previous epoch's end timestamp (taken right after its history row was written; epoch 1: the trainer call) to the end of this epoch's last optimizer.step(); includes step diagnostics, the progress line, the previous epoch's checkpoint_last.pt write and, for epoch 1, trainer set-up",
